simple association example
Association is a relationship between two independent classes where one object uses or interacts with another.
Both objects have their own lifecycle and can exist independently.
Example
class Bank {
    String bankName = "HDFC";
}

class Customer {
    String name;

    Customer(String name) {
        this.name = name;
    }

    void openAccount(Bank bank) {
        System.out.println(name + " opened an account in " + bank.bankName);
    }
}


